      "elements": [
        {
          "id": "d4afc20",
          "elType": "widget",
          "widgetType": "text-editor",
          "settings": {
            "editor": "<p style=\"font-family: 'Lora', serif; font-size: 1.1rem; line-height: 1.85; color: #4A5568; text-align: center;\">Plastic-Craft provides plastics that improve productivity, efficiency, and sustainability in farming and agriculture. Farmers and equipment manufacturers trust us because our plastics are lightweight, durable, and resistant to weather, chemicals, and wear.</p><p style=\"font-family: 'Lora', serif; font-size: 1.1rem; line-height: 1.85; color: #4A5568; text-align: center;\">From irrigation systems to harvesting equipment, our materials extend service life and reduce maintenance while improving crop yields. Greenhouse plastics offer high light transmission and UV stability, creating optimal growing conditions. Livestock and feed systems use our plastics for durability and hygiene. Plastic-Craft supports modern agriculture with plastics that help farms operate more efficiently, sustainably, and profitably.</p>",
            "align": "center"
          },
          "elements": []
        }
      ],
      "isInner": false
    },
    {
      "id": "5b2366d",
      "elType": "container",
      "settings": {
        "content_width": "full",
        "padding": {
          "unit": "px",
